# 十四、Request / Response 数据模型

每一个 Kafka Request 都应该生成统一 Trace Event。

例如：

```typescript
interface KafkaTraceEvent {
  traceId: string;
  timestamp: number;

  apiKey: number;
  apiName: string;
  apiVersion: number;

  correlationId: number;

  direction: "request" | "response";

  broker?: {
    id?: number;
    host: string;
    port: number;
  };

  topic?: string;
  partition?: number;

  requestSize?: number;
  responseSize?: number;

  latencyMs?: number;

  errorCode?: number;
  errorName?: string;

  request?: unknown;
  response?: unknown;

  rawRequest?: string;
  rawResponse?: string;
}
```

Trace Event 必须能够被 WebSocket 实时推送到前端。

